---
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro"
import { portraitImage } from "../data/images"
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="bg-background-alt palette-surface-light px-container-x py-section"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-landing gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <header class="lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:col-span-5 lg:self-start">
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">
        About the journal
      </p>
      <h2
        class="max-w-heading text-balance text-headline-2 leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight"
      >
        Fishing as a practice of attention, not a highlight reel.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-copy text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Fishing Adventures documents the decisions around a day on the water:
        reading weather, preparing a route, choosing less gear, and knowing when
        conditions ask you to leave.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:col-span-7">
      <Photo image={portraitImage} class="aspect-4/3 w-full" />
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed">
          What began with a hand-me-down rod became a long-running field study.
          Every trip adds another page: observations, failed ideas, small
          breakthroughs, and the places worth protecting.
        </p>
        <div>
          <blockquote class="text-headline-3 leading-tight font-semibold">
            “The catch is a moment. Learning the water is the life around it.”
          </blockquote>
          <dl
            class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 border-t border-border pt-6 text-sm"
          >
            <div>
              <dt class="text-muted">Approach</dt><dd
                class="mt-1 font-semibold"
              >
                Observe first
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-muted">Journal</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">
                126 field reports
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-muted">Waters</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">
                Fresh + salt
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-muted">Principle</dt><dd
                class="mt-1 font-semibold"
              >
                Leave no trace
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
